  <field_wiki_entry rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Late-decline social and administrative regime within the Center of Gravity characterized by sealed sectors, movement restriction, contamination fear, checkpointing, infrastructural isolation, and coercive inward control.

Represents the lived quarantine culture of the declining CoG rather than only a formal administrative policy.</field_wiki_entry>
