  <field_origin rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Developed from eccentric early competitive forms into a mature sport rewarding precision disarms, hook control, mobility, feints, and sudden angular changes.
</field_origin>
  <field_wiki_entry rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Fighting sport of the 42nd century centered on the use of a hooked stick or cane. Initially seen as slightly goofy because of its strange movement rules and footwork, it later evolved into an elite and highly technical competitive discipline.</field_wiki_entry>
  <field_aspect_class rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">sport</field_aspect_class>
