  <field_wiki_entry rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">! Introduction
Project One-Way is the first Interstellar Mission launched from [[system_sol]]. Initiated by the [[Independent Space Trust]]. It competed with several other craft in what was known as the [[evt_race_for_inter_sol]]. 

The Spacecraft was constructed around the [[BUS-1 Intersolar Engine]], a conceptual [[Bussard Ramjet]] design.


() Competitors

! Engineering 
() Drive
() Habitation
() </field_wiki_entry>
