  <field_name rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">CoG Breach Vent Tunnel</field_name>
  <field_location_class rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">internal_passage</field_location_class>
  <field_pretty_name rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">CoG Breach Vent Tunnel</field_pretty_name>
  <field_location_role rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">clandestine_exit_route</field_location_role>
  <field_wiki_entry rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Old ventilation shaft segment within the declining Center of Gravity whose structure cracked open at an opportune point, creating a clandestine physical exit from the quarantined megastructure.

Initially exploited by a late-CoG gang as a real escape route, later used for selected extractions, paid passage, police crackdown operations, and covert regime reuse.</field_wiki_entry>
